    "answer": {
      "short": "2060 students.",
      "worked": "The unit part is $\\frac{1}{5}$ of the students.\n\n3 parts represent 1236 students.\n\n1 part represents $1236\\div3=412$ students.\n\n5 parts represent $412\\times5=2060$ students.\n\nThere are 2060 students at the school.",
